WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.334
The robot arm moves from the left towards the black bowl located between the plate and the ramekin. It grasps the bowl, lifts it, and places it onto the plate.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Move arm towards the black bowl and grasp it

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Lift the bowl and move it over the plate

4
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Place the bowl on the plate and release
